2 CONC naces and Nysa. Pharnaces and Nysa received a crown of gold from them and bronze statues of themselves were set up on Delos. Their lengthy Athenian honorific inscription, is dated in the Archonship of the Athenian Tychandrus or Ty
2 CONC chander which is now generally accepted as 160 BC or 159 BC.
