2 CONT     Apama II of Bactria married King of Syria Seleucus I Nicator of Macedonia, son of Antiochus of Macedonia  and Laodice (?) , 0324 BC in Susa.1,2 She was born 0340 B.C.. She was the daughter of Satrap Spitamenes of Bactria and N
2 CONC . N. of Bithynia. Sources: 2. Bryan, K. 'Davidic Descents to the House of Plantagenet' Augustan, Vol. XXV, 16-23. ; 3. Yarshater, E. 'The Cambridge History of Iran' Vol.3#1, pp.4. ; 4. Green, P. 'Alexander to Actium' pp.734.
2 CONT
