2 CONC She was the daughter of Greek–Syrian King Antiochus VIII Grypus and Greek Ptolemaic Princess Tryphaena, a daughter of Ptolemy VIII. Laodice married Mithridates I Callinicus, a prince and future king of Commagene. The fathers of La
