2 CONT =Magas of Egypt=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Magas (in Greek Mαγας; 241 BC - 222 BC) was a grandson of Magas of Cyrene, being a son of Ptolemy Euergetes (246–221 BC) and Berenice. He was put to death by his brother Ptolemy Philopator (221–204 BC), soon after the accession of
2 CONC  the latter, at the instigation of Sosibius.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
