2 CONT H.S. Lund, Lysimachus: A Study in Early Hellenistic Kingship, Routledge, 2002
2 CONT W. Heckel, Who’s who in the age of Alexander the Great: prosopography of Alexander’s empire, Wiley-Blackwell, 2006
