1 OCCU Shah of Persia, aka Mnemon; aka Artaxerxes II Abataka; ACHAEMENID; 8th PHARAOH of the 27th Dynasty of EGYPT; during his reign Egypt became independent of the Persian Empire, but Persia regained the Ionian cities of Anatolia, of Pe
