1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artaxerxes_II_of_Persia
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT ID: I62226
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Artaxerxes II of Persia
