2 CONT Darius ll's' mother, Esther, as depicted in the Bible, was a pious woman who demonstrated great faith, resolve, mercy, and courage combined with reasonable caution. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther reigned as the queen of Persia for a period of about 13 years. With King Ahasuerus, she had one son, '''named Darius II,''' who would later rebuild the holy Temple in Jersusalem. 
