2 CONT [edit] Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Parthia derives from Latin Parthia, from Old Persian Parthava-, a dialectical variant of the stem Parsa-, from which Persia derives. Ashkanian appears to have come from the Sassanian chronicles, from which they entered in Ferdow
2 CONC si's epic poem Shahnama. 
