1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''
2 CONT =Antonia=
2 CONT '''
2 CONT
2 CONT Antonia was a daughter of Marcus Antonius the orator, who was the proconsul for the Roman province of Cilicia. She was abducted in Italy, during a visit to Misenum (modern Miseno), by the Cilician pirates with whom her father had 
2 CONC so often clashed. Her freedom was obtained only on payment of a large sum.
2 CONT
