1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mahendravarman II'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Mahendravarman II (Tamil: இரண்டாம் மகேந்திரவர்மன்) was a Tamil king of the Pallava dynasty who ruled South India from 668–672 CE. He was the son of Narasimhavarman I, a Tamil king of the Pallava dynasty who ruled South India from 
2 CONC 630–668 CE. He was succeeded by his son Paramesvaravarman I.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source : '''
