1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to Mommaerts, he was a grandson of [http://www.geni.com/people/Decimus-Rusticus/6000000004089149574 Decimus Rusticus] and and his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Artemia/6000000010299987649 Artemia] thro
2 CONC ugh their [http://www.geni.com/people/no-name/6000000008406749608 unnamed son] who married [http://www.geni.com/people/Tullia/6000000005747722679 Tullia]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He (or perhaps his possible brother [http://www.geni.com/people/Eucherius/6000000026256539273 Eucherius]) might have been the father of Rusticus, bishop of Lyons; Justinus; Sacerdos; and perhaps Viventiolus, bishop of Lyons.
