1 NOTE {geni:about_me} According to Mommaerts, he was perhaps a grandson of [http://www.geni.com/people/Decimus-Rusticus/6000000004089149574 Decimus Rusticus] and and his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Artemia/6000000010299987649 Artem
