1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Echestratus was King of Sparta from about 900 to 870 BC. He was a son of Agis I, and third of the Agiad line of Spartan kings. In his reign the district of Cynuria on the Argive border was reduced. He was the fathe
2 CONC r of Labotas or Leobotes, king of Sparta.[1] his grandson was Doryssus.
