2 CONC nknown.2 Saint Gondoule Governor of Marseilles, Mayor of the Palace, and Bishop of Tongres served in 581 as Governor of Marseilles. He was later Mayor of the Palace to Thiebert II.2,3 He accepted holy orders in 599, and was made B
2 CONC ishop of Tongres.2 He died on Monday, 6 July 607 at age 83 years.2,3 
