1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Chulabhaya was the son of king Amandagamini Abhaya and the ruler of Anuradhapura in the 1st century. He reigned for a short period of time from 33 to 35. He succeeded his uncle Kanirajanu Tissa as King of Anuradhap
2 CONC ura and was succeeded by his sister Sivali.
