2 CONT !6.  BODEGISEL (Duke of Bodegise) d. "an old man" 581; brother of St. Gondolful, Bishop of Tongres.  He mat. PALATINE, dau. of GALLUS MAGNUS, Gallo-Roman Bishop of Toryes c.562.
2 CONT
