1 CONT     * Hazel, John; Who's Who in the Greek World, "Mithridates I" (1999)
1 CONT     * Memnon, History of Heracleia, Andrew Smith (translator), (2004)
1 CONT     * Plutarch, Parallel Lives, "Demetrius", John & William Langhorne (translator), (1770)
1 CONT     * Smith, William (editor); Dictionary of Greek and Roman Biography and Mythology, "Mithridates III", Boston, (1867)
1 CONT     * Strabo, Geography, H. C. Hamilton & W. Falconer (translators), London, (1903)
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
