0 @N6000000002187624015@ NOTE Cleopatra V of Egypt
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Cleopatra V of Egypt (Greek: ??e?p?t?a) was the mother of Cleopatra VII, by her husband and brother Ptolemy XII of Egypt, and was possibly the mother of Cleopatra VI of Egypt and Berenice IV. She co-ruled Egypt with her daughter B
1 CONC erenice IV for a year before her death, when her daughter reigned alone in Egypt.
1 CONT [edit]
