1 CONT "Gyges of Lydia" by Jona Lendering at www.livius.org 
1 CONT " GYGES AND HOMER" by Livio C. Stecchini 
1 CONT Retrieved from "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gyges_of_Lydia"
