1 CONC . The placement of Isaac II as son of Tirots I seems to fit historically and chronologically but has not been proven. He was the son of Tirots I Bagratuni. Insurgent Viceroy of Armenia between 482 and 483.2 Prince of the Bagratids
1 CONC  before 483. He died in 483 in the Battle of Akesga.  
1 CONT
1 CONT
