1 CONT rebellious son, Chram, together with Chram's family, put to death". Early
1 CONT writer Gregory of Tours describes Chlotar, wracked with fever on his
1 CONT deathbed, asking---whether in outrage or in admiration---what manner of
1 CONT heavenly king it was to bring great rulers to their deaths in such a fashion.
